{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:07 2026-09-12 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:07 2026-09-12 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:07 2026-09-12 HKT</p><p>太子荔枝角道發生撞車揭毒駕事件。據報，一部私家車今日（9月12日）中午近1時沿塘尾道北行，當駛至荔枝角道交界時，48歲姓潘男司機撞向一輛在前方的輕型貨車。</p><p>警員接報到場，發現男司機正在吸食含有懷疑依托咪酯的電子煙，快速口腔液測試呈陽性。其後緝毒犬到場協助蒐證，警員在私家車內檢獲三包可卡因。經初步調查，男司機涉嫌「藥後駕駛」、「管有危險藥物」及「不小心駕駛」被捕，現正被扣留調查。</p><img alt=\"涉案私家車。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ee7a62102aad9778b5b24234faac24b5/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_13_49_04_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/073c65607149da27385c0ca2fe01018c/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_13_49_05.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"客貨車被私家車追撞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3643596412324aa9e804f728beaba7e0/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_13_49_05_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"私家車收掣不及撞客貨車的車尾。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d352bf91ae920e23504919351786bba5/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_13_49_05_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/232771d3a8076036022b9127ba9edb7c/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_13_49_06.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員帶同警犬搜車。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d2c5cc8e548f83e20d3b9381be4b288/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_13_49_54_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員押解疑犯搜車。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e610cb80cd1807769de8d7a5291f069/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_13_49_55_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"緝毒犬奉召到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/16f133ad39398e76d855ae2a86a115a7/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_13_49_55_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05d7680bbb78aab21f003098fcfecc59/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_13_49_54_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"緝毒犬奉召到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4be81abce1e7e0c33cf27e70033f0741/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_13_49_53.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4480ebee34ae7787f73b7012e183ca0e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_13_49_06_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/722608ade9cdc0ced5ab798b9b8ac58f/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_13_49_04_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/598ebda77e3ff6d0f8b74be416090c5a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_13_49_04.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T12:19:50.206670+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":273,"images":13,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}